        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-131, Timeless Newbury Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Newbury Cabinet Knob will surely stand the test of time and ever-changing fads which means you can change your decor without having to change your cabinet hardware. That is because of its timeless design which allows it to blend seamlessly into almost any decor from modern to traditional just from which of the beautiful finishes you choose. Polished Nickel would look great in ultra modern homes while the Oil Rubbed Bronze finish gives this cabinet pull a more classic look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/newbury-cabinet-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Newbury Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-timeless-newbury-refrigerator-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6631\"><b>Matching Newbury Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newbury Collection Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
